This {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak{cmd:7F0306}
already holds a record
for {cmd:7F25}, eek eek.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}If you go ahead,{cmd:7F0308}
the record on this
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak{cmd:7F0306}
for {cmd:7F25} will be erased.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Do you still want
to travel, eek eek?{cmd:7F1600290062}{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F0D}{cmd:7F0F0946}{cmd:7F100947}{cmd:7F19}
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F090000FF}I always{cmd:7F0306}
make a note when someone
asks me to run an errand.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Who asked,{cmd:7F0306}
who it's for,{cmd:7F0306}
and what to deliver{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Write those things down,{cmd:7F0306}
then cross them off
as you finish,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}One or two errands are easy,{cmd:7F0306}
but if you agree to lots
at once, it's easy
to get mixed up!
{cmd:7F00}

Sorry to keep you waiting!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Now,{cmd:7F0304} let's have
a good chat today!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

Thanks for waiting.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Hmhm.
I'd like to sit and have
a good chat,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000016}How do you{cmd:7F0306} tell the time
without a clock nearby,{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}I look at the sunlight
coming into my house!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}The sun rises in the east,
passes through the south,{cmd:7F0306}
and sets in the west!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Once you know that,{cmd:7F0306}
you can work out
the time pretty well!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000017}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}Of course,{cmd:7F0306}
that trick won't work
once it gets dark.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}If you want to leave letters
with us while visiting
another town,{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}you need the same
{cmd:7F09000017}{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak
you used to get here.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}I'm very sorry,{cmd:7F0308}
but please insert the correct
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,{cmd:7F09000015}{cmd:7F0308}
then come back and see us.
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F0900000F}Oh,{cmd:7F0308} that's a different
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak{cmd:7F0304} you've put in.{cmd:7F0310}
Nope.{cmd:7F0306} Can't do it.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}If you want to leave letters
with us while you're
visiting another town,{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}you have to use the
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak
you arrived with.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Put in the right
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,
then{cmd:7F0308} come back, OK?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Sorry for{cmd:7F0306} the trouble.{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F05969696}{cmd:7F5100}(Honestly, it's common sense!){cmd:7F5101}
{cmd:7F01}
